<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JUNE NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 13 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JUNE NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 13 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations of new private</p>
<p>cars in Finland rose 13.4 percent year-on-year in June to 9,004</p>
<p>units, after a 1.1 percent fall in May, the Information Centre</p>
<p>of the Automobile Branch said in its monthly review on Monday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p>				     change			  change</p>
<p>		   June'97	yr/yr pct    Jan-June'97  yr/yr pct</p>
<p> Private cars    9,004	 +13.4	   59,293	 +5.8</p>
<p> Vans		1,082	 +61.0	    5,980	+32.0</p>
<p> Lorries	     334	 +21.5	    2,055	+18.0</p>
<p> Buses		  39	 -11.8		256	 +0.8</p>
<p> Total	    10,450	 +17.2	   67,584	 +8.0</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
